Package: shiny-chainsaw
Section: editors
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lightweight Markdown viewer for technical docs
 Shiny Chainsaw is a Markdown viewer written in C with GTK3. The Markdown
 parser is implemented in the source tree, so rendering does not depend on an
 external Markdown library. Tables, task lists, strikethrough, autolinks and
 the GFM raw-HTML grammar are supported; the open file re-renders when it
 changes on disk.
